<title>USA: Polygram forms new company.</title>
<headline>Polygram forms new company.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Calif. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PolyGram NV's PolyGram Filmed Entertainment said Friday it had formed PolyGram Films, a new motion picture distribution company, to release major studio-level features in the domestic market.</p>
<p>It said all of its domestic film distribution activities will be consolidated under the newly formed PolyGram Filmed Entertainment Distribution unit.</p>
